 ('h2', 'After the conversion'),
 ('p', 'Once you have JSON, a <a href="../tools/json-formatter.html">JSON formatter</a> pretty-prints and validates it so you can confirm the structure is right before using it. If the source data had duplicate rows, cleaning them first with <a href="../tools/remove-duplicate-lines.html">Remove Duplicate Lines</a> gives a tidier result. And because the conversion runs entirely in your browser, you can safely convert sensitive data, customer records, internal exports, without any of it being uploaded, which matters a great deal when the CSV contains personal information.'),
 ('h2', 'Choosing between an array of objects and other shapes'),
